{"ID":"20251009111931-1jlsds4","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20251009111931-1jlsds4","title":"UPL7-4——物理系统基础设置","type":"doc","updated":"20251031172748"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031144346-9v9qg9z","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20251031144346-9v9qg9z","updated":"20251031145613"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"物理系统基础设置"}]},{"ID":"20251031144352-kny7wtb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031144352-kny7wtb","updated":"20251031144547"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们可以在 Project Settings 中对物理系统进行一些基础设置，\n这些设置看起来只是和物理系统相关，但是实际上其中有很多的参数都会实实在在的影响我们的性能，\n因此，了解这些基础设置，对于我们优化性能也有一定的帮助！"}]},{"ID":"20251031144556-a3ci10y","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251031144556-a3ci10y","name":"Solver","updated":"20251031145613"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"解算器"}]},{"ID":"20251031144710-s9xnezr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031144710-s9xnezr","updated":"20251031145233"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"解算器（Solver）在 Unity 物理系统里其实是指物理系统里负责解方程的模块，就是 Unity 物理中用来处理碰撞，关节约束的方程求解器\n它决定物体在发生接触后该怎么调整位置和速度，迭代次数越多越稳定，代价是 CPU 的消耗也更高（迭代指的就是解算器的计算次数）"}]},{"ID":"20251031144906-0k4010a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031144906-0k4010a","updated":"20251031145320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在物理模拟中，碰撞检测只是发现 物体 A 和物体 B 重叠或接触，检测到重叠或者接触后，接下来要处理两个问题："}]},{"ID":"20251031145012-q6ohk14","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251031145012-q6ohk14","updated":"20251031145012"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031145012-2ei6o52","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251031145012-2ei6o52","updated":"20251031145012"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031145012-bivh9df","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031145012-bivh9df","updated":"20251031145017"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"它们要分开多少"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031145017-enlbkdk","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251031145017-enlbkdk","updated":"20251031145017"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031145017-quph0ml","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031145017-quph0ml","updated":"20251031145028"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"它们的速度，角速度要怎么调整？"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251031145028-1wcbjbr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031145028-1wcbjbr","updated":"20251031145044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这就涉及到一系列约束条件："}]},{"ID":"20251031145044-fho9a5w","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251031145044-fho9a5w","updated":"20251031145045"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031145045-j4nqhj9","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251031145045-j4nqhj9","updated":"20251031145045"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031145045-1o66dkp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031145045-1o66dkp","updated":"20251031145054"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"碰撞不允许重叠，需要位置约束"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031145055-quixin0","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251031145055-quixin0","updated":"20251031145055"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031145055-eocraz9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031145055-eocraz9","updated":"20251031145108"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摩擦，弹性系数要生效，需要速度约束"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031145108-atekjqd","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251031145108-atekjqd","updated":"20251031145108"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031145108-cox4nts","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031145108-cox4nts","updated":"20251031145123"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关节要维持结构，需要关节约束"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251031145124-ww0ktqf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031145124-ww0ktqf","updated":"20251031145159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这些约束本质上会形成一组线性方程和不等式，解算器就是负责解这些方程，求出新的位置与速度"}]},{"ID":"20251031145339-bglt7md","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031145339-bglt7md","updated":"20251031145413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"举例：解算器在 Unity 内的作用"}]},{"ID":"20251031145414-5wxlxea","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031145414-5wxlxea","updated":"20251031145414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"输入信息："}]},{"ID":"20251031145413-ab9wyaa","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251031145413-ab9wyaa","updated":"20251031145413"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031145413-26jo3z9","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251031145413-26jo3z9","updated":"20251031145413"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031145413-5bzluxl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031145413-5bzluxl","updated":"20251031145429"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"碰撞检测生成的接触点"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031145429-dcg93t4","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251031145429-dcg93t4","updated":"20251031145429"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031145429-3srxb3a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031145429-3srxb3a","updated":"20251031145434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所有关节约束"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031145435-pedv8uq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251031145435-pedv8uq","updated":"20251031145435"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031145435-iybsel3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031145435-iybsel3","updated":"20251031145450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Rigidbody 的质量，惯性，速度，力"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251031145454-iov8q9p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031145454-iov8q9p","updated":"20251031145457"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]},{"ID":"20251031145451-cupvyyj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031145451-cupvyyj","updated":"20251031145552"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"过程：按一定的算法迭代求解（近似解，不是数学上的精确解），每迭代一次，位置和速度就更接近符合物理规律的状态"}]},{"ID":"20251031145553-op2q0ph","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031145553-op2q0ph","updated":"20251031145613"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"输出：更新后的 Rigidbody 的位置，选择，速度，角速度"}]},{"ID":"20251009112005-7ovxo6f","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251009112005-7ovxo6f","updated":"20251031152905"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3D 物理系统设置"}]},{"ID":"20251031152446-hwdu1x1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20251031152446-hwdu1x1","updated":"20251031152905"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Shared（共享）页签"}]},{"ID":"20251031152653-1wny9wr","Type":"NodeSuperBlock","Properties":{"id":"20251031152653-1wny9wr","updated":"20251031152905"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockLayoutMarker","Data":"col"},{"ID":"20251031152501-ld3w5u8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031152501-ld3w5u8","updated":"20251031152654"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20251031152620-c6h902m.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251031152621-c0hv3io","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251031152621-c0hv3io","updated":"20251031152905"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031152623-gusiptl","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","id":"20251031152623-gusiptl","updated":"20251031152905"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031152623-70j1hxh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031152623-70j1hxh","updated":"20251031152629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Gravity 重力"}]},{"ID":"20251031152837-w2gp3a0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031152837-w2gp3a0","updated":"20251031152841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用 x、y 和 z 轴来设置应用于所有刚体组件的重力大小。\n对于现实的重力设置，请对 y 轴应用负数。重力以每秒平方世界单位定义。"}]},{"ID":"20251031152846-0odoojm","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20251031152846-0odoojm","updated":"20251031152905"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20251031152847-bisfgaq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031152847-bisfgaq","updated":"20251031152905"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注意"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：如果您增加重力，您可能还需要增加 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20251009111956-rgrx2hx","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"Default Solver Iterations（默认解算器迭代次数）"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 值以保持稳定的接触。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251031152630-rkn0ko8","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","id":"20251031152630-rkn0ko8","updated":"20251031152630"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031152630-c4yircm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031152630-c4yircm","updated":"20251031152818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Layer Collision Matrix 碰撞层矩阵"}]},{"ID":"20251031152700-rwxme11","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031152700-rwxme11","updated":"20251031152742"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"定义 基于层的碰撞 检测系统如何运行。要选择碰撞矩阵上哪些层与其他层交互，请选中它们各自的复选框。"}]},{"ID":"20251031152744-t97rwjm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031152744-t97rwjm","updated":"20251031152815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关于碰撞层矩阵，详见："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20251009111152-26uqqgj","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"UPL7-3——碰撞层矩阵"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"ID":"20251031151410-yvx30wl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20251031151410-yvx30wl","updated":"20251009112046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Game Object 页签"}]},{"ID":"20251009112045-p4gtgfm","Type":"NodeSuperBlock","Properties":{"id":"20251009112045-p4gtgfm","updated":"20251009112046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockLayoutMarker","Data":"col"},{"ID":"20251009112041-c9ofyx0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251009112041-c9ofyx0","updated":"20251009112046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20251009112042-fwd2fgh.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251009111956-lfne4cq","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251009111956-lfne4cq","updated":"20251031150959"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251009111956-ftvac2f","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251009111956-ftvac2f","updated":"20251009112310"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251009111956-0dfs7uo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251009111956-0dfs7uo","updated":"20251009111956"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"基础参数"}]},{"ID":"20251009111956-h2x9s16","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251009111956-h2x9s16","updated":"20251009112310"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251009111956-uvmss3g","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","id":"20251009111956-uvmss3g","updated":"20251009112310"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251009111956-2gplehq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251009111956-2gplehq","updated":"20251009112310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Default Material（默认物理材质）"}]},{"ID":"20251009112301-4gp41b6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251009112301-4gp41b6","updated":"20251009112304"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"设置默认的物理材质，如果 Collider 没有指定材质，就会用这个。\n物理材质决定摩擦系数、弹性等"}]}]},{"ID":"20251009111956-agfi214","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","id":"20251009111956-agfi214","updated":"20251009111956"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251009111956-j7llccp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251009111956-j7llccp","updated":"20251009112158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Bounce Threshold（反弹阈值）"}]},{"ID":"20251009112155-8i9qv7k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251009112155-8i9qv7k","updated":"20251009112155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小于这个相对速度的碰撞不会触发弹性反弹（会被当作静止接触处理），避免低速抖动"}]}]},{"ID":"20251009111956-ni4azzy","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","id":"20251009111956-ni4azzy","updated":"20251009111956"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251009111956-s1rthi7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251009111956-s1rthi7","updated":"20251009112224"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Default Max Depenetration Velocity（默认最大脱离速度）"}]},{"ID":"20251009112142-ain7pqy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251009112142-ain7pqy","updated":"20251009112142"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当物体重叠时，物理引擎会把它们推出去。这个值限制推出的最大速度，防止过快弹飞。"}]}]},{"ID":"20251009111956-jtr7owd","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","id":"20251009111956-jtr7owd","updated":"20251009111956"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251009111956-w5v491h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251009111956-w5v491h","updated":"20251009112230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Sleep Threshold（休眠阈值）"}]},{"ID":"20251009112230-trrd5f9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251009112230-trrd5f9","updated":"20251009112230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"刚体速度（线性 + 角速度）低于这个阈值时，进入“休眠”以减少计算"}]}]},{"ID":"20251009111956-p3fjd7l","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","id":"20251009111956-p3fjd7l"