ing（使用多线程）"}]},{"ID":"20251011103843-znsqymo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011103843-znsqymo","updated":"20251011103843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"启用 2D 物理的多线程 Job 系统。开启后，物理运算会分配到多个 CPU 核心"}]}]},{"ID":"20251011102327-fyp8pxg","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","id":"20251011102327-fyp8pxg","updated":"20251031154334"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251011102327-14h5bw8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011102327-14h5bw8","updated":"20251031154334"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Use Consistency Sorting（启用一致性排序）"}]},{"ID":"20251011103848-ferue2g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011103848-ferue2g","updated":"20251011103851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"保证任务执行顺序可预测（调试时更稳定）。\n关闭会更快，但可能出现非确定性结果"}]}]},{"ID":"20251011102327-di4uzdw","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","id":"20251011102327-di4uzdw","updated":"20251031154341"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251011102327-r7lx07m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011102327-r7lx07m","updated":"20251031154341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Job 分批参数（每个 Job 处理多少对象）"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "}]},{"ID":"20251011103900-ekxylu0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011103900-ekxylu0","updated":"20251011103912"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"决定各种物理计算任务（插值、接触生成、清理等）如何分批给 Job\n数值越大 "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"="}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Job 数量少（减少调度开销，单 Job 任务重）\n数值越小 "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"="}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Job 数量多（更分散，可利用更多线程，但调度开销大）"}]},{"ID":"20251011102327-c4q6oeh","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251011102327-c4q6oeh","updated":"20251011102327"},"Children":[{"ID":"2025101110232