"Island Solver（岛屿解算器）相关"}]},{"ID":"20251011103954-tuw3gj5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011103954-tuw3gj5","updated":"20251011104013"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"物理系统会把一组相互作用的刚体、关节、碰撞点组成一个 Island（岛屿），然后单独解算，下面这些参数决定 岛屿解算如何拆分到多线程执行，控制何时分 Job 解算"}]},{"ID":"20251031172710-7slg1dx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031172710-7slg1dx","updated":"20251031172748"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关于岛屿相关内容，可见："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20251031162656-7mel3ue","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"UPL7-7——刚体相关"}]},{"ID":"20251011102327-79ql6a4","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251011102327-79ql6a4","updated":"20251011102327"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251011102327-57an61b","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251011102327-57an61b","updated":"20251011102327"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251011102327-yrcjetg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011102327-yrcjetg","updated":"20251011102327"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Island Solver Cost Threshold： 当岛屿的计算成本超过该阈值时，会拆分为多个 Job"}]}]},{"ID":"20251011102327-q9emtoh","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251011102327-q9emtoh","updated":"20251011102327"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251011102327-o9e7qt0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011102327-o9e7qt0","updated":"20251011102327"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Island Solver Body Cost Scale： 刚体的计算成本系数。值越大，刚体对总计算成本影响越大"}]}]},{"ID":"20251011102327-htfpkpo","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251011102327-htfpkpo","updated":"20251011102327"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251011102327-yuo05gf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251011102327-yuo05gf","updated":"20251011102327"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Island Solver Contact Cost Scale： 接触点的计算成本系数"}]}]},{"ID":"202